    <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--testimony);margin:0 0 36px;max-width:68ch;">
      The line that actually divides these: reporting versus enforcing. <span class="mono">decide</span> and <span class="mono">check</span> report: they hand back an answer and run nothing. <span class="mono">assert</span>, <span class="mono">enforce</span>, <span class="mono">enforceProjected</span> and <span class="mono">filter</span> enforce: each refuses an allow whose obligation nobody has discharged.
    </p>
